":"Learn to distinguish between:"},{"type":"p","text":"True formation response vs measurement/environmental effects."}]},{"heading":"Advanced Logging Technologies","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Become familiar with:"},{"type":"h","text":"Wireline Logging"},{"type":"p","text":"Tools conveyed into the well after drilling or during specific well operations."},{"type":"h","text":"Logging While Drilling"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand how formation measurements can be acquired while drilling."},{"type":"h","text":"Formation Imaging"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the fundamentals of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Electrical borehole imaging"},{"text":"Acoustic imaging"},{"text":"Fracture identification"},{"text":"Bedding interpretation"},{"text":"Structural interpretation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Nuclear Magnetic Resonance"},{"type":"p","text":"Study NMR concepts such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"T₂ relaxation"},{"text":"Pore-size distribution"},{"text":"Bound-fluid volume"},{"text":"Free-fluid volume"},{"text":"Permeability estimation concepts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Production Logging"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand logs used to investigate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Fluid movement"},{"text":"Water production"},{"text":"Gas production"},{"text":"Inflow"},{"text":"Injection behavior"}]}]},{"heading":"Well Logging Data Analysis","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop skills in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"Depth matching"},{"text":"Curve editing"},{"text":"Log normalization"},{"text":"Crossplots"},{"text":"Statistical analysis"},{"text":"Formation segmentation"},{"text":"Automated interpretation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"NumPy"},{"text":"pandas"},{"text":"matplotlib"},{"text":"SciPy"},{"text":"Jupyter"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential machine-learning applications:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Lithology classification"},{"text":"Facies prediction"},{"text":"Missing-log reconstruction"},{"text":"Well-log clustering"},{"text":"Formation-property prediction"},{"text":"Automated log interpretation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"AI should complement, not replace, geological and petrophysical interpretation."}]},{"heading":"Software & Tools","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Industry Software"},{"type":"p","text":"Become familiar with professional subsurface platforms such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SLB Techlog"},{"text":"SLB Petrel"},{"text":"Halliburton DecisionSpace"},{"text":"Interactive Petrophysics (IP)"},{"text":"WellCAD"},{"text":"Kingdom"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Exact software availability varies by employer."},{"type":"h","text":"Programming"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"MATLAB"},{"text":"SQL basics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Visualization"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful tools:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Python plotting"},{"text":"Specialized well-log visualization software"}]}]},{"heading":"Projects to Build","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Basic Well-Log Interpretation"},{"type":"p","text":"Take an open educational/sample well-log dataset."},{"type":"p","text":"Analyze:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Gamma ray"},{"text":"Resistivity"},{"text":"Density"},{"text":"Neutron"},{"text":"Sonic"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Identify:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Lithology"},{"text":"Porosity"},{"text":"Potential reservoir intervals"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Output","text":"Complete interpreted well-log plot and technical report."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Petrophysical Evaluation"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a Python workflow that calculates:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Shale volume"},{"text":"Porosity"},{"text":"Water saturation"},{"text":"Hydrocarbon saturation"},{"text":"Net reservoir"},{"text":"Net pay"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Create a depth-based formation evaluation report."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — ML-Based Lithology Classification"},{"type":"p","text":"Use well-log data to classify formations."},{"type":"p","text":"Possible workflow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Logs","Data Cleaning","Feature Engineering","ML Model","Lithology Prediction","Evaluation"]},{"type":"p","text":"Models could include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Random Forest"},{"text":"Gradient Boosting"},{"text":"XGBoost"},{"text":"Neural Networks"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Evaluate using:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Accuracy"},{"text":"Precision"},{"text":"Recall"},{"text":"F1 score"},{"text":"Confusion matrix"}]}]},{"heading":"Advanced Capstone Project","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"AI-Assisted Formation Evaluation System"},{"type":"p","text":"Build an end-to-end system:"},{"type":"h","text":"Input"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Gamma ray"},{"text":"Resistivity"},{"text":"Density"},{"text":"Neutron"},{"text":"Sonic"},{"text":"Caliper"},{"text":"Depth"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Processing"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"Depth alignment"},{"text":"Missing-value treatment"},{"text":"Feature engineering"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Interpretation"},{"type":"p","text":"Predict:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Lithology"},{"text":"Porosity"},{"text":"Water saturation"},{"text":"Reservoir intervals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a dashboard showing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Well-log curves"},{"text":"Formation intervals"},{"text":"Predicted lithology"},{"text":"Porosity profile"},{"text":"Saturation profile"},{"text":"Net-pay intervals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Final Output"},{"type":"h","text":"Automated Well-Log Formation Evaluation Report"},{"type":"p","text":"This is particularly valuable for demonstrating the combination of Petroleum Engineering + Petrophysics + Data Science."}]},{"heading":"Choose a Specialization","kind":"other","blocks":[